{title: Heavens Jubilee}
{key: C}

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Oh what singing oh what shouting
On that happy morning when we [D7]all shall [G]rise
[C]Oh what glory [F]hallelujah
[C]When we meet our Blessed Savior [G]in the [C]skies

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]Some glad morning we shall see Jesus in the air
Coming after you and me [D7]joy is ours to [G]share
[C]What rejoicing there will be when the saints shall rise
Headed for that jubilee [G]yonder in the [C]skies

{comment: Verse 2}
[C]Seems that now I almost see all the sainted dead
Rising for that jubilee [D7]that is just a[G]head
[C]In the twinkling of an eye changed with them to be
All the living saints to fly [G]to that jubi[C]lee

{comment: Verse 3}
[C]When with all that heavenly host we begin to sing
Singing in the holy ghost [D7]how the heavens will [G]ring
[C]Millions there will join the song with them we shall be
Praising Christ through ages long [G]heaven's jubi[C]lee
